        "syllabusHeading": "III. Audit Process: (Weightage – 30 per cent)",
        "syllabusText": "Planning and Designing of Audit: Understanding entity, risk analysis, audit programming, desk review, Audit Design Matrix (ADM). Execution: Entry/exit conference, audit requisition/audit enquiry/audit observation, Audit evidence. Reporting: Different types of audit reports of IAAD, Executive summary, characteristics of good audit report. Follow up: PAC/Legislative Committees, ATN/ATR.",
