        "syllabusText": "Descriptive statistics. Graphical and numerical representation of data. Measures of central tendency (mean, median, mode) and dispersion. Basic Concepts of Correlation. Sampling techniques (Questions should test the ability of candidates to apply statistical concepts in a typical audit situation).",
