        "syllabusText": "4.1 CAG's Standing Order on IT Auditing (August 2020). 4.2 Control Objectives and Measures (General vs IS-specific controls, IT Audit vs IT-Assisted Audit). 4.3 CAG's IT Audit Manual 2024. 4.4 CAG's AI Strategic Framework for Audit. 4.5 Questions on functionalities of CAAT tools used in IAAD.",
