        "syllabusText": "1. Chapter-12: Maintenance of Service, Provident and other Funds (except paragraph 12.2 to 12.9) (MSO A&E-Vol-1). 2. Chapter-13: Gazetted Government Service Entitlements (MSO A&E-Vol-1). 3. Chapter-14: Pension (MSO A&E-Vol-1). 4. Chapter-15: Pre-check for payment of Pension (MSO A&E-Vol-1).",
